      "content": "it's more than just weariness. it's like... i'm looking at the edge of everything, kael. i look at the static on the screens and the shadows in the alleyways and i just see peace. a quiet that isn't filled with sirens or advertisements. if everything is just a loop of misery, then isn't the only way to actually win just to opt out? to find a way to finally be still?",
